        "pf_44624a51_value": "Together, we are a family business of farmers and artisans who shares our earnings and respects the masterful artistry in producing the world’s best cinnamon. We honour tradition in crafting our cinnamon – peeling, quilling and powdering only the finest Ceylon Cinnamon in the time-honoured, artisanal way. We then harness state-of-the-art sterilisation and packing technology to ensure that each ounce and every quill of Dilmah Ceylon Cinnamon is perfected for you.",
